        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Loop</strong> is a brutally hard, fast-paced 2D precision platformer set in a fiery underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is carefully handcrafted with lethal traps, tight timing windows, and instant-death hazards. One mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>48 escalating stages</strong>, the pressure never lets up — demanding perfect movement, sharp reflexes, and total focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>solo or in local co-op (2 players)</strong>. Team up with a friend to survive the chaos together, or challenge yourself alone and prove your mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 levels, you’ll face one of <strong>five unique bosses</strong>, each featuring distinct behaviors, attack patterns, and <strong>multi-phase encounters</strong> designed to punish hesitation and reward precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you reach the end… the real nightmare begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARDCORE MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life.</strong><br><strong>No checkpoints.</strong><br><strong>No second chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full run from Level 1 to the Final Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill. No mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 48 handcrafted, hell-themed levels<br>• 5 intense boss fights with multi-phase encounters<br>• Brutally precise, reflex-driven platforming<br>• Local co-op mode (2 players)<br>• Hardcore Mode: a one-life challenge for true mastery<br>• Escalating difficulty and unforgiving level design<br>• Fast retries and instant respawns<br>• Easy to learn, hard to master controls<br>• Steam achievements and skill-based progression</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hell Loop</strong> is a brutally hard, fast-paced 2D precision platformer set in a fiery underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every level is carefully handcrafted with lethal traps, tight timing windows, and instant-death hazards. One mistake means death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across <strong>48 escalating stages</strong>, the pressure never lets up — demanding perfect movement, sharp reflexes, and total focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>solo or in local co-op (2 players)</strong>. Team up with a friend to survive the chaos together, or challenge yourself alone and prove your mastery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 10 levels, you’ll face one of <strong>five unique bosses</strong>, each featuring distinct behaviors, attack patterns, and <strong>multi-phase encounters</strong> designed to punish hesitation and reward precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And once you reach the end… the real nightmare begins.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >HARDCORE MODE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One life.</strong><br><strong>No checkpoints.</strong><br><strong>No second chances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full run from Level 1 to the Final Boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pure skill. No mercy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• 48 handcrafted, hell-themed levels<br>• 5 intense boss fights with multi-phase encounters<br>• Brutally precise, reflex-driven platforming<br>• Local co-op mode (2 players)<br>• Hardcore Mode: a one-life challenge for true mastery<br>• Escalating difficulty and unforgiving level design<br>• Fast retries and instant respawns<br>• Easy to learn, hard to master controls<br>• Steam achievements and skill-based progression</p>",
        "short_description": "A brutal test of skill and reflexes. 48 handcrafted levels, deadly traps, and intense boss fights. Play solo or in local co-op — and unlock Hardcore Mode for the ultimate one-life challenge.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Korean, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish, Ukrainian, Czech, Swedish, Japanese",
        "reviews": "“If you are looking for an incredibly challenging game that will frustrate you, but at the same time feels incredibly rewarding when you successfully complete a stage, Hell Loop is one to check out.”<br>7/10 – GameGrin<br>",
